  "ruleText": "He-P 4033.04 Application for Specific Licenses of Broad Scope. An application for specific license of broad scope shall be made according to the requirements set forth in He-P 4033.05.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-P 4033) #6942, eff 2-1-99; ss by #8800, INTERIM, eff 2-1-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-07\n\nNew. #8959, eff 8-7-07; ss by #10983, eff 11-24-15",
